+// SPDX-License-Identifier: ISC
+/* Copyright (C) 2020 MediaTek Inc.
+ *
+ * Author: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>
+ *	   Lorenzo Bianconi <lorenzo@kernel.org>
